@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/deliveries

### 1. Create Delivery for Customer (Assumes customer with ID 1 exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "quantity": 20,
  "notes": "Medical supplies - priority express delivery"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("lastDeliveryId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. List All Deliveries
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Delivery by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{lastDeliveryId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Discover Deliveries for Customer 1 (Follow HATEOAS relation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customer/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Update Delivery
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{lastDeliveryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "quantity": 25,
  "notes": "Updated: Deliver before 10:00 AM"
}

### 6. Delete Delivery
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{lastDeliveryId}}
